<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36756" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plŭvĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		pluo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>rainy</i>, <i>causing</i> or <i>bringing rain</i>, <i>rain-</i> (class.): SI
			AQVA PLVVIA NOCET, <i>rain-water</i>, Fragm. XII.
			Tab.; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Mur. 9, 22</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				Top. 9, 38</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tempestates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 2, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caelum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 13, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hyades,</span>”
				<i>rain-bringing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 516</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 17, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rores,</span>”
				<i>rain</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 3, 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arcus,</span>”
				<i>rainbow</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id. A. P.
					18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Juppiter,</span>”
				<i>who dispenses rain</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tib. 1,
					8</span></i>
			 (7), 26 (cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Juppiter uvidus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 418</span></i>
			, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἰκμαῖος</span>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 2,
					15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caeli status,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 2, 39, § 106</span></i>
			.—Hence, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">plŭvĭum</span></b> ,
				ii, n., = impluvium, q. v., <i>the inner court of a dwelling</i>, <i><span class="en">Ter. Eun.
				3, 5, 41</span></i>.</div>
